# Benchmark path "house turn" (PLAN_LOWS M3). Starts in the state house (free control inside the hero's house after the intro). Fixed game
# step: a 300-frame camera turn each way. Windows "bench: house_turn1/2 start/end" (tools/perf/bench_window.py --house).
@rate 60
30
@shot house_start
@log bench: house_turn1 start
stick right 1 0 for 300
@log bench: house_turn1 end
30
@log bench: house_turn2 start
stick right -1 0 for 300
@log bench: house_turn2 end
30
@shot house_end
@rate 0
@log bench: house_turns done